# Cloudflare Pages response headers — Vite copies `public/` into `dist/web`, so these ship with the bundle.
# These are the verbatim rules `vercel.json` carried before the web host moved to Cloudflare (see
# docs/RELEASE-PIPELINE.md §5); `scripts/ci/probe-deploy.sh` asserts the behaviour they encode.

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-store
  Service-Worker-Allowed: /
